    "title": "Layer-by-layer growth (GaN paper parameters)",
    "story": "Temperature, effective Ga flux, and all four barriers come from the paper's fitted expressions for Ga/N = 0.82, not from the sliders. Adatoms are mobile enough to complete each layer before the next nucleates, so the surface returns to nearly flat every monolayer and the proxy oscillates with a ~1 ML period. This is the textbook RHEED oscillation the whole model is aiming at.",
